### Breakable pill bottles
rmc-pill-bottle-broken-examine = [color=red]The top has been broken open. It is unusable like this.[/color]
rmc-pill-bottle-broken-examine-repair = [color=cyan]If you have the know-how, you'd probably be able to bend the top back into place with something that can pinch it.[/color]
rmc-pill-bottle-broken = The {$bottle} is broken...
rmc-pill-bottle-must-hold = The {$bottle} must be in your hand to do that.

### Breaking the lid
rmc-pill-bottle-already-broken = The {$bottle} has already been broken open!
rmc-pill-bottle-break-start-self = You place the tip of the {$tool} underneath the lid of the {$bottle} and begin torquing the lid off{ $canOpen ->
        [yes] , though you could probably just open it normally.
       *[no] .
    }
rmc-pill-bottle-break-start-others = {$user} places the tip of the {$tool} underneath the lid of the {$bottle} and begins torquing the lid off...
rmc-pill-bottle-break-cancel = You stop forcing the lid off of the {$bottle}.
rmc-pill-bottle-break-spill-self = You pop the lid off of the {$bottle}, spilling some of its contents everywhere!
rmc-pill-bottle-break-spill-others = {$user} pops the lid off of the {$bottle}, spilling some of its contents everywhere!
rmc-pill-bottle-break-self = You pop the lid off of the {$bottle}, breaking it in the process.
rmc-pill-bottle-break-others = {$user} pops the lid off of the {$bottle}.

### Repairing the lid
rmc-pill-bottle-not-broken = The {$bottle} isn't broken, there's no need to fix it.
rmc-pill-bottle-repair-no-skill = You have no idea how to fix this thing.
rmc-pill-bottle-repair-start-self-1 = After fiddling with it for a moment, you grip the end of the bent lid of the {$bottle} with the {$tool} and begin bending the plastic rim into useable form.
rmc-pill-bottle-repair-start-others-1 = {$user} fiddles with the {$bottle} for a moment, before bending the rim back into place with the {$tool}.
rmc-pill-bottle-repair-start-self-2 = You precisely place the tip of the {$tool} on the bent rim of the {$bottle} and begin bending it back into place.
rmc-pill-bottle-repair-start-others-2 = {$user} calmly grips the {$bottle} with the tip of the {$tool}, and begins bending the rim back into place.
rmc-pill-bottle-repair-start-self-3 = In one smooth motion, you grip the rim of the {$bottle} with the {$tool} and bend it back into place.
rmc-pill-bottle-repair-start-others-3 = In one smooth motion, {$user} grips the bent rim of the {$bottle} with the {$tool} and bends it back into place.
rmc-pill-bottle-repair-cancel = You stop fixing the {$bottle}.
rmc-pill-bottle-repair-self = You succeed in fixing the {$bottle}.
rmc-pill-bottle-repair-others = {$user} successfully bends the rim of the {$bottle} back into place, fixing it.
